<a class='cta-guiding ' href='https://als.ca/what-is-als/' ><div class='cta-guiding-content'>
<i class='fa-regular fa-brain-circuit'></i><h3 class='cta-guiding-title'>What is ALS?</h3><div class='cta-guiding-description'><p>ALS is a progressive, neurodegenerative disease with no cure and few treatments.</p></div></div><div class='cta-guiding-link'><span>Learn about ALS <i class='fa-solid fa-arrow-right'></i></span></div>
</a></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6 vc_col-lg-3 vc_col-md-3 vc_col-xs-6"><div class="vc_column-inner vc_custom_1721098745614"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
<a class='cta-guiding br-0' href='https://als.ca/managing-als/' ><div class='cta-guiding-content'>
